                        "review": "Hey I like the music! \nFor rest, you just pay me the 10 minutes I spend in this terrible game. I mean, if you want people to get a wrong perception of what VR is capable of, then please publish more trash games like this. It's not worth the 5 EUR. Sorry, developers. It's nothing personal. But we need to stick all together in order to make VR a success and programs like this are part of the trash wave we are recently seeing. It's counter-productive. Especially if you ask money for it. So please stop.\n\n[i] Twitch Channel : https://www.twitch.tv/mrorange55\nYoutube Channel : https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC1UE5TPoF0HX0HVpF_E4uPQ/videos?view_as=subscriber [/i]",
